  description: "Masan\u0131n kenar\u0131nda duran \xE7ay barda\u011F\u0131, kolayca
    devrilerek s\u0131cak s\u0131v\u0131n\u0131n \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar\u0131n \xFCzerine
